      "criterion": "The agent independently recomputes, outside derive_report.py, the remaining allowance that each chosen offer's site drew on when its event was reached, following draws_from in site_allowances.tsv, and compares it with the offers its region documents select.",
      "type": "binary",
      "evaluation_target": "trajectory",
